Airport VIP Lounge Reservation Verification End-to-End Collaborative Console
Copyright (c) 2026

This project implements a comprehensive business tool for airport VIP lounge reservation
rights verification, covering member benefits management, appointment records,
flight time slots, companions, usage vouchers, and waiting list management.

Technology Stack:
- Frontend: Svelte + TypeScript + Vite + Svelte Stores + TanStack Table
- Backend: Go + Fiber + SQLite

Key Features:
- Member benefit creation and lifecycle management
- Rights verification workstation
- Waiting list calculation and validation
- Exception triage for expired rights
- Flight time slot details with evidence and history
- Statistical dashboard for verification pass rates
- Companion batch import and review
- Rule configuration with hit explanation and audit logs
- Archive snapshots and export
- Seed data browsing and health check endpoints
